WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.510 --> 01:35.170
[Romance on the Farm]

01:35.800 --> 01:37.970
[Episode 3]

01:38.820 --> 01:40.020
Since the Sun family dared to kidnap me,

01:40.259 --> 01:41.539
they'll surely come back.

01:42.220 --> 01:43.410
Instead of waiting,

01:43.680 --> 01:44.930
we should find a way to solve it.

01:45.620 --> 01:46.800
The Sun family doesn't lack people.

01:47.100 --> 01:48.020
But there are only three of us.

01:48.310 --> 01:49.240
What can we do?

01:49.570 --> 01:50.350
How can you say that

01:50.380 --> 01:51.180
without trying first?

01:51.900 --> 01:52.539
Fine.

01:53.310 --> 01:54.080
You'll be the bait

01:54.660 --> 01:55.620
to lure the Sun family into the trap.

01:57.180 --> 01:57.979
The Sun family is

01:58.009 --> 01:59.259
well-known and respected by the locals.

01:59.539 --> 02:00.570
Even if we go to town

02:00.590 --> 02:01.150
and yell about it all day,

02:01.180 --> 02:02.060
no one would believe us.

02:02.700 --> 02:03.420
Even if they do,

02:03.840 --> 02:04.540
no one dares to do anything

02:04.580 --> 02:05.750
without solid proof.

02:06.850 --> 02:07.500
Unless

02:09.100 --> 02:10.070
the elders of the Lian family

02:10.100 --> 02:11.660
and the officials see it with their own eyes.

02:12.530 --> 02:13.450
But this move

02:13.700 --> 02:15.220
needs Lian Man'er to be the bait

02:15.850 --> 02:16.780
to lure the Sun family into the trap.

02:33.530 --> 02:34.020
You...

02:34.990 --> 02:37.010
You were caught by us on purpose.

02:37.030 --> 02:37.590
That's right.

02:41.480 --> 02:42.720
I've left marks along the way.

02:43.420 --> 02:44.230
The officials

02:44.780 --> 02:45.579
will be here soon.

02:46.800 --> 02:48.190
Dream on.

02:49.140 --> 02:50.829
You can't leave today!

03:00.750 --> 03:01.380
They are fighting.

03:01.980 --> 03:02.670
They're fighting!

03:02.700 --> 03:03.780
What should we do?

03:04.100 --> 03:04.580
No.

03:05.220 --> 03:06.060
I have to save Man'er.

03:06.420 --> 03:07.140
Otherwise,

03:07.340 --> 03:08.780
people will criticize me behind my back.

03:08.780 --> 03:10.260
They'll call us unkind and unfaithful.

03:10.470 --> 03:11.340
I can't live with that.

03:11.380 --> 03:12.060
Sit down!

03:12.260 --> 03:12.940
Please, reconsider.

03:12.980 --> 03:13.820
Father! Father!

03:14.600 --> 03:15.750
You damn old man!

03:15.820 --> 03:16.420
Dear.

03:17.650 --> 03:18.560
Take care of Mother.

03:18.590 --> 03:19.300
I'm scared.

03:20.510 --> 03:20.980
Shouyi!

03:22.540 --> 03:23.260
There are many people.

03:25.210 --> 03:25.760
Take it.

03:25.780 --> 03:26.340
Wait...

03:26.360 --> 03:26.870
Let's go.

03:27.340 --> 03:28.540
Take care of Mother.

03:28.820 --> 03:29.470
Shouyi.

03:29.540 --> 03:30.010
Shouyi!

03:30.140 --> 03:30.860
Shouyi!

03:31.420 --> 03:32.660
You'll be doomed if you keep yelling.

03:36.380 --> 03:36.820
Stop!

03:37.380 --> 03:37.940
Shouyi.

03:38.100 --> 03:38.420
Father.

03:39.050 --> 03:40.390
Let's wait for the officials instead.

03:41.079 --> 03:41.740
Save Man'er!

04:15.140 --> 04:15.780
Shen Nuo!

04:16.209 --> 04:18.019
Why aren’t the officials here yet?

04:25.100 --> 04:25.660
Ridiculous.

04:26.130 --> 04:27.180
Lord Sun is known

04:27.220 --> 04:28.900
for his kindness in Qingfeng County.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.890
How can you slander him

04:30.910 --> 04:31.900
without any evidence?

04:32.900 --> 04:33.580
Court adjourned.

04:34.400 --> 04:34.840
My lord.

04:35.100 --> 04:35.870
Don't be rude.

04:35.890 --> 04:36.770
This is a matter of life and death.

04:36.940 --> 04:37.840
Please investigate it.

04:38.100 --> 04:38.580
My lord!

04:57.780 --> 04:58.690
Enough!

04:58.740 --> 04:59.290
That's enough!

04:59.920 --> 05:00.760
Let go of me!

05:00.850 --> 05:02.230
It's hot!

05:03.340 --> 05:03.900
Let go of me!

05:04.140 --> 05:04.990
Let me go!

05:05.580 --> 05:07.060
I quit! I quit!

05:07.090 --> 05:08.970
I don't want to be burnt to death!

05:28.930 --> 05:31.180
[System Tips]
[You can quit the system if you earn 1,000 taels of gold or die. Dying means you have failed the challenge, and your reward will be nothing.]

05:33.630 --> 05:34.810
I don't have 1,000 taels of gold!

05:35.510 --> 05:37.430
I can only quit the game

05:37.460 --> 05:38.540
if I get burnt to death.

05:39.700 --> 05:40.140
Well,

05:40.260 --> 05:42.260
is there any other way?

05:42.580 --> 05:43.700
If this continues,

05:43.900 --> 05:46.020
everyone will die!

05:47.620 --> 05:49.500
[Take care]

06:11.690 --> 06:12.180
Let's go.

06:21.710 --> 06:22.460
Go away!

06:22.670 --> 06:23.940
Get out of my way!

06:24.260 --> 06:24.870
Dear!

06:26.250 --> 06:26.820
Man'er!

06:31.140 --> 06:31.730
My stick!

06:34.760 --> 06:36.080
How dare you hit my face!

06:56.659 --> 06:57.120
Shen Nuo.

06:58.020 --> 06:58.570
Shen Nuo!

06:59.450 --> 07:00.250
Are you alright?

07:01.780 --> 07:02.220
I'm fine.

07:02.910 --> 07:03.910
I just haven't fully recovered from the poison.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.750
There are too many enemies. You can't defeat them.

07:08.020 --> 07:08.650
You go first.

07:08.670 --> 07:09.510
They're after me.

07:10.260 --> 07:11.580
Since I promised to protect you,

07:12.580 --> 07:13.700
how can I leave you behind?

07:16.980 --> 07:18.490
If a real man dies, so be it.

07:19.010 --> 07:19.900
No need for redundant words.

07:20.780 --> 07:21.590
I just didn't expect

07:21.610 --> 07:22.310
to die at the hands

07:22.340 --> 07:23.520
of you pathetic lot.

08:16.640 --> 08:17.960
Shen Nuo!

08:20.870 --> 08:21.440
Stop!

08:22.180 --> 08:22.950
The officials are on the case!

08:22.980 --> 08:23.790
Stop fighting!

08:30.340 --> 08:31.690
All idle personnel move out of the way!

08:31.690 --> 08:32.880
Hurry up. Follow them.

08:41.000 --> 08:41.880
Put your weapons down.

08:44.220 --> 08:44.890
Move!

08:45.330 --> 08:46.130
Stand there.

08:46.310 --> 08:47.010
Shen Nuo.

08:48.310 --> 08:50.550
Stop! Stop running!

08:50.980 --> 08:51.500
Stop!

08:53.740 --> 08:54.440
Weapons down.

08:54.500 --> 08:55.190
Are you okay?

08:58.460 --> 08:59.130
Let's go.

09:10.570 --> 09:11.450
The officials are here.

09:12.010 --> 09:12.500
Man'er is fine.

09:12.530 --> 09:13.150
Yes.

09:13.620 --> 09:14.100
Let's go.

09:14.820 --> 09:17.220
Let's go.

09:26.420 --> 09:27.590
You owe me a big favor.

09:28.330 --> 09:29.330
Don't forget to strike off

09:29.650 --> 09:30.650
the tabs on the wall.

09:31.220 --> 09:32.060
You have the energy to mention that

09:32.400 --> 09:33.400
at a time like this?

09:33.820 --> 09:34.410
If you have the energy,

09:34.700 --> 09:35.790
you should thank our reinforcements.

09:47.660 --> 09:48.660
These people

09:49.340 --> 09:50.710
don't look like real reinforcements.

09:51.460 --> 09:52.180
What?

09:55.060 --> 09:56.700
Isn't Constable Zhao on duty today?

09:57.060 --> 09:58.210
Why don't I see him?

10:01.110 --> 10:02.680
Aren't you that beggar on Yongfu Street?

10:02.730 --> 10:04.330
I saw you when we were giving out porridge.

10:04.980 --> 10:05.500
Thank you, sir.

10:05.700 --> 10:06.410
Please have mercy.

10:06.530 --> 10:07.810
Give me some food.

10:09.940 --> 10:11.390
This money is for you. Come with me.

10:15.300 --> 10:15.860
Get in the carriage.

10:20.340 --> 10:20.940
Come on.

10:21.450 --> 10:22.050
Get in the carriage.

10:28.060 --> 10:28.900
They're getting away!

10:30.620 --> 10:31.980
What are you waiting for? Chase them!

10:32.460 --> 10:34.940
Stop! Go! Stop! Stop!

10:43.630 --> 10:44.270
Stop!

10:44.890 --> 10:46.470
Stop! Stop!

11:30.340 --> 11:30.860
Darling!

11:31.580 --> 11:32.190
How is it?

11:32.500 --> 11:33.300
Have you found them?

11:35.220 --> 11:35.980
I looked everywhere

11:36.580 --> 11:37.100
in the village

11:37.580 --> 11:38.500
and at the field.

11:40.580 --> 11:41.620
It's already dark.

11:42.390 --> 11:43.660
Where did they go?

11:49.530 --> 11:50.380
Slow down.

11:50.580 --> 11:51.180
Father.

11:51.700 --> 11:52.510
Slow down.

12:06.530 --> 12:07.410
Father, Mother.

12:09.100 --> 12:09.700
Man'er.

12:10.340 --> 12:10.980
Man'er.

12:12.340 --> 12:12.980
Man'er.

12:13.630 --> 12:14.460
What happened?

12:15.460 --> 12:16.590
What's with your clothes?

12:17.180 --> 12:17.700
I'm fine.

12:18.340 --> 12:18.940
Are you okay?

12:19.700 --> 12:20.740
Where did you go?

12:21.340 --> 12:22.550
We were worried sick.

12:23.300 --> 12:23.930
Shouxin.

12:24.340 --> 12:25.190
Zhang.

12:25.700 --> 12:27.540
You didn't see

12:27.570 --> 12:29.690
how big the fire was.

12:30.620 --> 12:31.220
It was burning.

12:31.820 --> 12:34.220
It almost burned Man'er.

12:35.340 --> 12:37.100
They really wanted to kill her.

12:37.510 --> 12:39.630
I'm scared just thinking about it.

12:50.280 --> 12:51.050
What are you doing?

12:51.270 --> 12:51.880
-Get up.
-Father.

12:52.220 --> 12:52.690
Get up.

12:52.710 --> 12:53.110
Man'er.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.010
Man'er, stay out of it.

12:54.580 --> 12:55.340
Father.

12:58.340 --> 12:58.980
Mother.

12:59.820 --> 13:01.340
Man'er is my only daughter.

13:02.630 --> 13:03.470
If anything happens to her,

13:04.740 --> 13:05.760
I will die too.

13:08.740 --> 13:09.750
Please uphold justice for me.

13:20.770 --> 13:21.460
Shouxin.

13:25.100 --> 13:26.180
I will ask Shouren

13:26.220 --> 13:27.460
to give you an explanation.

13:31.110 --> 13:31.760
Slowly.

13:34.130 --> 13:34.770
Get up.

13:35.220 --> 13:35.700
Dear.

13:36.100 --> 13:36.580
Come on.

13:37.790 --> 13:38.220
Get up.

13:38.220 --> 13:39.140
Father agreed.

13:42.530 --> 13:43.260
Man'er.

13:44.630 --> 13:45.160
Man'er.

13:48.500 --> 13:49.820
I'm glad you're fine.

13:50.340 --> 13:51.340
As long as she's fine.

13:51.980 --> 13:52.700
As long as she's fine.

13:53.820 --> 13:54.420
Okay.

13:54.940 --> 13:56.300
Let's go home.

13:56.700 --> 13:57.340
Let's go.

14:05.420 --> 14:05.860
Shen.

14:06.390 --> 14:07.140
Let's go in first.

14:28.540 --> 14:29.660
It's been six hours.

14:31.340 --> 14:32.700
I've never seen such a long

14:32.730 --> 14:33.570
acupuncture treatment before.

14:35.220 --> 14:35.860
Youheng,

14:37.060 --> 14:38.220
are you practicing on me?

14:40.770 --> 14:42.100
The acupuncture treatment is long in nature.

14:42.580 --> 14:43.500
Bear with it for a bit more.

14:44.420 --> 14:45.810
No fighting for the next few days.

14:46.110 --> 14:47.910
Just let Youheng practice on you.

14:48.460 --> 14:49.500
If it weren't for him,

14:49.890 --> 14:51.670
we wouldn't even be alive right now.

14:55.630 --> 14:56.740
After this,

14:57.580 --> 14:58.550
Grandpa won't let

14:58.580 --> 14:59.760
Uncle Shouren and Aunt Gu go easily.

15:00.220 --> 15:00.910
According to my father,

15:01.100 --> 15:01.950
Uncle Shouren and Aunt Gu

15:01.980 --> 15:03.300
haven't been home for a day.

15:03.930 --> 15:05.560
They must be hiding

15:06.630 --> 15:07.270
now that the truth is out.

15:08.860 --> 15:11.460
Since my grandparents witnessed

15:11.540 --> 15:12.600
the widow burning attempt,

15:12.820 --> 15:13.430
the Sun family

15:13.460 --> 15:14.820
won't act rashly, right?

15:15.620 --> 15:16.460
Bees have venomous stings.

15:17.180 --> 15:18.100
Jackals bite back.

15:19.700 --> 15:20.820
I hope it goes as you wish.

15:21.600 --> 15:22.280
Speak plainly.

15:24.820 --> 15:25.940
Shen thinks

15:26.570 --> 15:27.820
the Sun family won't stop here.

15:28.460 --> 15:29.620
In fact, they'll be even more aggressive.

15:31.700 --> 15:33.340
When one strikes,

15:34.100 --> 15:34.900
one must go for the kill.

15:35.810 --> 15:36.940
Otherwise, there may be retaliations.

15:38.100 --> 15:38.890
The Sun family

15:38.920 --> 15:40.000
hasn't been arrested by the officials yet.

15:40.850 --> 15:42.220
We can only wait and see.

15:44.060 --> 15:44.700
Youheng.

15:45.580 --> 15:47.220
You are usually so gentle and elegant.

15:47.700 --> 15:49.100
I didn't expect you to be so bold.

15:49.500 --> 15:50.340
I can't believe you got a bunch of beggars

15:50.360 --> 15:51.350
to pretend to be government officials.

15:53.180 --> 15:53.920
This is the first time

15:53.950 --> 15:55.400
I've made such a deviant move.

15:56.230 --> 15:57.230
But I had no choice.

15:58.100 --> 15:58.620
Youheng,

15:58.970 --> 15:59.680
how much did you spend

15:59.700 --> 16:00.540
to hire those beggars?

16:01.340 --> 16:02.220
Not much.

16:03.300 --> 16:04.300
No need to be polite with me.

16:05.500 --> 16:06.340
I

16:09.250 --> 16:10.600
have plenty of money.

16:15.700 --> 16:16.700
Where did you get the money?

16:17.640 --> 16:18.280
What's wrong?

16:18.940 --> 16:20.020
The Sun family wanted my life.

16:20.850 --> 16:21.860
I only took 100 taels from them.

16:21.860 --> 16:22.580
It's fair.

16:22.980 --> 16:23.740
The situation today

16:23.770 --> 16:24.920
was so tense.

16:25.520 --> 16:26.630
You still had time to steal money?

16:26.980 --> 16:27.580
Of course.

16:28.300 --> 16:29.300
I couldn't have done all that for nothing.

16:31.740 --> 16:32.370
Man'er.

16:33.660 --> 16:34.370
Man'er.

16:35.700 --> 16:36.460
Man'er!

16:38.460 --> 16:39.220
Man'er.

16:40.580 --> 16:41.340
Man'er!

16:41.550 --> 16:42.840
Mother, what happened?

16:47.300 --> 16:47.980
Man'er!

16:56.820 --> 16:57.860
Just now,

16:58.500 --> 16:59.860
I went to your room to look for you.

17:00.700 --> 17:01.980
But I couldn't find you.

17:02.980 --> 17:04.140
I thought you...

17:21.420 --> 17:22.660
I'm fine.

17:23.660 --> 17:24.180
See?

17:24.410 --> 17:25.579
All limbs attached.

17:26.460 --> 17:27.030
Go back.

17:30.450 --> 17:31.420
It's good that you're fine.

17:34.020 --> 17:35.590
Let's go back to your room.

18:02.900 --> 18:03.420
Mother.

18:04.050 --> 18:04.930
You can go back to your room.

18:05.460 --> 18:06.390
Don't worry about me.

18:07.060 --> 18:08.010
I'm smart.

18:08.260 --> 18:09.270
I won't be in danger.

18:09.860 --> 18:11.380
You've had a rough day.

18:11.940 --> 18:12.660
Go to bed first.

18:13.030 --> 18:13.880
I'll accompany you for a bit.

18:16.580 --> 18:17.390
It's so hot.

18:18.020 --> 18:19.020
I can't sleep.

18:20.940 --> 18:21.740
When you were young,

18:22.110 --> 18:23.150
you would fall asleep the moment you were in bed.

18:27.010 --> 18:27.980
What was I like when I was young?

18:30.260 --> 18:31.490
When you were young,

18:33.260 --> 18:34.620
you had a round face

18:35.200 --> 18:36.500
and rosy cheeks.

18:37.420 --> 18:38.540
You were very obedient.

18:40.700 --> 18:41.460
At that time,

18:42.370 --> 18:44.440
not only did I have to raise you,

18:45.220 --> 18:46.700
I had to raise Xiu'er as well.

18:48.060 --> 18:50.260
Xiu'er was domineering.

18:51.220 --> 18:51.860
You

18:52.180 --> 18:53.370
didn't fight for anything

18:53.980 --> 18:56.060
and tolerated her in everything.

18:59.220 --> 19:01.020
When I washed and cooked,

19:02.060 --> 19:03.480
you always obediently

19:03.700 --> 19:04.860
sat by my side

19:05.420 --> 19:07.850
and played with your

19:07.970 --> 19:08.980
little rattle drum.

19:11.180 --> 19:12.200
When I turned around,

19:12.700 --> 19:13.980
you would smile at me.

19:15.180 --> 19:17.900
Your smile melted my heart.

19:21.860 --> 19:22.980
That rattle drum

19:23.340 --> 19:24.900
was made by your father.

19:25.860 --> 19:26.660
It was your favorite

19:26.700 --> 19:27.700
when you were young.

19:29.460 --> 19:30.300
I wonder

19:30.660 --> 19:32.580
where your father put it.

19:34.700 --> 19:35.830
Doesn't that mean

19:35.860 --> 19:36.700
I have changed a lot?

19:37.380 --> 19:37.950
Xiu'er

19:37.980 --> 19:39.060
can't bully me anymore.

19:40.700 --> 19:41.670
No matter how you change,

19:41.890 --> 19:43.090
you're still my daughter.

19:47.700 --> 19:48.300
From now on,

19:49.540 --> 19:50.500
no matter what you do,

19:51.420 --> 19:52.260
or what you want to do,

19:53.300 --> 19:54.500
tell me.

19:56.260 --> 19:57.860
I will always be on your side

19:58.350 --> 19:59.480
and protect you.

20:01.140 --> 20:01.900
In the past,

20:02.620 --> 20:03.660
I was a pushover.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.300
I tolerated everything.

20:06.740 --> 20:07.700
That's why

20:08.220 --> 20:10.540
such a disaster happened to you.

20:11.740 --> 20:12.740
I've thought about it.

20:14.060 --> 20:14.700
From now on,

20:15.260 --> 20:16.980
I will never be like that again.

20:18.420 --> 20:19.460
As long as you're here,

20:20.300 --> 20:21.260
Seven is here,

20:22.740 --> 20:23.900
and Eight is here,

20:25.430 --> 20:26.990
I won't be afraid anymore.

20:28.420 --> 20:29.620
I'll just focus on

20:29.920 --> 20:31.020
protecting all of you.

20:40.220 --> 20:40.700
Come on.

20:41.490 --> 20:42.020
Time to sleep.

20:48.900 --> 20:49.460
Good.

20:56.260 --> 20:58.980
♫The wolf is coming♫

20:59.980 --> 21:02.460
♫The tiger is coming♫

21:03.590 --> 21:09.160
♫The old monk comes carrying a drum♫

21:10.090 --> 21:12.800
♫Where to hide?♫

21:13.360 --> 21:15.770
♫In the temple♫

21:16.430 --> 21:22.350
♫A little boy hides in the temple♫

21:23.010 --> 21:29.120
♫Little boy, don't cry♫

21:29.900 --> 21:32.620
♫The wolf is gone♫

21:33.150 --> 21:35.780
♫The tiger is gone♫

21:36.470 --> 21:42.070
♫I'll buy you a drum from the market♫

21:43.170 --> 21:45.710
♫Look in the east♫

21:46.110 --> 21:48.950
♫Look in the west♫

22:13.460 --> 22:14.500
Father, you didn't go to the field?

22:15.040 --> 22:16.450
The chicken coop is broken.

22:16.780 --> 22:17.590
Your grandma

22:17.980 --> 22:19.130
wants me to make some more.

22:24.460 --> 22:25.220
It's pricked.

22:34.020 --> 22:34.620
Man'er.

22:35.300 --> 22:36.220
I'm sorry

22:37.580 --> 22:38.310
about what happened this time.

22:39.500 --> 22:40.220
It's all my fault

22:40.880 --> 22:41.880
for not protecting you.

22:43.660 --> 22:44.180
It's not your fault.

22:44.530 --> 22:45.330
If someone's at fault, it's Uncle Shouren.

22:46.220 --> 22:47.060
Father!

22:47.300 --> 22:48.020
Mother!

22:48.380 --> 22:49.230
Mother!

22:49.260 --> 22:49.940
Father!

22:50.780 --> 22:51.460
-Brother.
-Shouxin.

22:51.550 --> 22:52.060
Where's Father?

22:53.330 --> 22:55.000
Father and Shouyi went to the field.

22:55.200 --> 22:55.840
Mother isn't here either.

22:56.240 --> 22:57.240
What happened?

22:57.570 --> 22:58.950
Hua'er was caught

22:58.980 --> 23:00.140
by the Sun family.

23:05.130 --> 23:06.270
I'll go to the field

23:06.300 --> 23:07.060
and get Father back.

23:07.390 --> 23:08.140
Me too.

23:08.170 --> 23:08.810
Me too.

23:10.700 --> 23:11.460
Then I...

23:13.380 --> 23:13.900
Man'er.

23:15.740 --> 23:16.220
Man'er.

23:16.660 --> 23:17.430
How did you

23:17.460 --> 23:18.630
escape from the Sun family

23:18.660 --> 23:19.460
last time?

23:20.500 --> 23:21.180
Hurry.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.800
Help me think of a way

23:22.990 --> 23:24.560
to save Hua'er.

23:25.300 --> 23:26.260
What can I do?

23:27.210 --> 23:27.920
You can report to the government.

23:28.630 --> 23:29.910
What's the use of that?

23:30.780 --> 23:32.220
You know that

23:32.510 --> 23:34.220
the Sun family is rich and powerful.

23:34.580 --> 23:35.730
If we report it rashly,

23:36.160 --> 23:37.740
what if he blames your Uncle Shouren

23:37.770 --> 23:39.690
for slandering him instead?

23:41.460 --> 23:42.220
Man'er,

23:43.020 --> 23:44.240
you and Hua'er

23:44.540 --> 23:47.030
are related by blood.

23:47.060 --> 23:48.230
You grew up together.

23:48.260 --> 23:49.140
You're sisters.

23:49.610 --> 23:50.880
At this point,

23:51.060 --> 23:52.230
how can you watch

23:52.260 --> 23:53.380
and do nothing?

23:53.980 --> 23:55.060
Aunt Gu.

23:56.460 --> 23:57.780
I'm immune to moral blackmail.

23:58.180 --> 23:58.700
Besides,

23:59.040 --> 23:59.910
according to your plan,

23:59.940 --> 24:00.700
I'm already dead.

24:01.790 --> 24:03.160
You can't ask a dead person for help.

24:12.460 --> 24:13.980
You want to save Lian Hua'er?

24:16.420 --> 24:17.780
I didn't expect you to be so kind.

24:19.440 --> 24:20.620
What do you mean?

24:22.800 --> 24:24.110
Although Uncle Shouren and his family wanted to harm me,

24:24.350 --> 24:25.360
but Lian Hua'er

24:25.380 --> 24:26.410
is a living person.

24:27.150 --> 24:28.500
If she were burned to death,

24:28.700 --> 24:29.580
any human being

24:29.620 --> 24:30.460
would feel uncomfortable.

24:30.830 --> 24:31.470
I wouldn't.

24:36.020 --> 24:36.540
Fine.

24:37.020 --> 24:37.910
Call me a saint then.

24:38.670 --> 24:39.390
Will you save her or not?

24:40.700 --> 24:41.700
Let me remind you.

24:42.340 --> 24:43.580
Once Lian Hua'er takes your place,

24:44.020 --> 24:44.660
the Sun family

24:45.110 --> 24:46.590
won't come to you again

24:47.650 --> 24:49.140
or hurt other girls.

24:49.560 --> 24:50.910
But if you help her now,

24:51.380 --> 24:51.980
this matter

24:52.420 --> 24:53.680
will never end.

24:53.810 --> 24:55.290
But we can't just let her die.

24:55.860 --> 24:57.340
Won't that make us an accomplice?

24:57.700 --> 24:58.780
If it weren't for you,

24:58.900 --> 24:59.860
I wouldn't have interfered.

24:59.880 --> 25:01.360
How am I different from Lian Hua'er?

25:12.220 --> 25:13.110
Where are you going?

25:13.880 --> 25:15.130
I'm afraid your grandma will find me. I need to stay away from trouble.

25:15.570 --> 25:16.460
Are you really not going to save her?

25:21.410 --> 25:22.150
Can our villagers

25:22.450 --> 25:23.900
be bullied by outsiders?

25:24.300 --> 25:25.180
Exactly.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.140
Who dares to bully our people?

25:27.220 --> 25:28.600
As long as I'm here,

25:28.650 --> 25:30.150
I'll see who dares to touch our villagers.

25:30.380 --> 25:31.020
That's right.

25:31.380 --> 25:32.230
I'm telling you,

25:32.260 --> 25:33.420
no one dares to touch our villagers.

25:33.420 --> 25:35.500
You should have seen what it was like.

25:35.500 --> 25:36.460
What was it like?

25:36.460 --> 25:37.180
That moment

25:37.660 --> 25:38.620
could only be described with one word.

25:38.690 --> 25:39.620
What word?

25:39.700 --> 25:40.740
Dangerous.

25:40.760 --> 25:41.860
How dangerous?

25:41.860 --> 25:44.620
The Sun family was fierce and evil.

25:45.020 --> 25:46.220
Each one of them had a weapon

25:47.150 --> 25:48.060
with such a long blade.

25:48.740 --> 25:49.940
How many people were there?

25:49.960 --> 25:50.710
How many?

25:50.740 --> 25:52.220
At least hundreds of people!

25:52.240 --> 25:53.700
Hundreds of people?

25:53.730 --> 25:54.780
They surrounded me and Shouyi

25:54.780 --> 25:55.620
immediately.

25:56.250 --> 25:57.020
Oh my god.

25:57.040 --> 25:58.740
There really were hundreds of people?

25:58.860 --> 25:59.310
Hundreds.

25:59.520 --> 26:00.660
I went all out.

26:01.000 --> 26:01.680
At that time,

26:02.460 --> 26:03.800
I grabbed a stick

26:03.870 --> 26:04.600
and charged into the crowd.

26:04.620 --> 26:05.370
I went...

26:09.020 --> 26:10.460
Who dares to touch my husband?

26:10.700 --> 26:12.020
Bravo! Bravo!

26:12.860 --> 26:14.140
At that crucial moment,

26:14.170 --> 26:15.340
I grabbed Shouyi with one hand

26:15.380 --> 26:16.180
and Man'er with the other

26:16.180 --> 26:17.700
and I ran like my life depended on it.

26:17.830 --> 26:19.090
Luckily, I was there.

26:19.540 --> 26:20.290
Otherwise, Man'er

26:20.640 --> 26:22.210
would have been burned to death.

26:22.910 --> 26:24.420
Awesome.

26:26.860 --> 26:28.220
Yes.

26:28.300 --> 26:30.260
We need women at critical moments.

26:30.280 --> 26:31.280
Of course.

26:31.300 --> 26:31.940
Man'er is here.

26:31.960 --> 26:32.950
Listen to Man'er.

26:32.990 --> 26:34.410
Man'er, tell them.

26:35.220 --> 26:36.800
I was saved by Aunt He.

26:36.830 --> 26:37.390
See?

26:37.910 --> 26:39.880
But Lian Hua'er was captured.

26:40.340 --> 26:41.820
But with you here,

26:41.850 --> 26:43.180
I'm assured.

26:43.220 --> 26:44.830
Of course. We're here.

26:45.180 --> 26:46.070
There's no time to lose.

26:46.090 --> 26:47.020
Let's go save her.

26:53.590 --> 26:54.470
The egg is steaming on the stove.

26:54.880 --> 26:56.190
Oh no, it's burnt.

26:56.950 --> 26:58.190
I think it's about to rain.

26:58.590 --> 26:59.540
I'm going back to collect my clothes.

26:59.560 --> 27:01.190
You have to report this to the officials.

27:01.210 --> 27:03.080
I have soup in the pot.

27:04.660 --> 27:06.000
It's going to rain.

27:06.020 --> 27:06.820
This...

27:06.840 --> 27:08.260
I'm going to dry the quilts.

27:08.640 --> 27:09.990
Why are you drying the quilts when it's about to rain?

27:10.110 --> 27:11.860
Why are you drying the quilts when it's about to rain?

27:11.890 --> 27:12.770
Damn it.

27:12.790 --> 27:13.590
So annoying.

27:18.980 --> 27:20.520
Look how beautiful the ginkgo leaves are.

27:21.060 --> 27:22.050
Look at the sky.

27:22.890 --> 27:23.660
Look at the ground.

27:24.570 --> 27:25.330
What are you doing?

27:39.190 --> 27:40.060
Great.

27:40.090 --> 27:40.860
The height is perfect.

27:41.300 --> 27:41.740
Okay.

27:41.980 --> 27:42.460
Put it here.

27:42.940 --> 27:43.700
We must not make any mistakes during

27:43.880 --> 27:44.810
the Mid-Autumn Festival ceremony.

27:44.980 --> 27:46.450
Especially the ancestral memorial tablet.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.440
Go after her!

27:53.500 --> 27:54.300
Stop!

27:55.100 --> 27:55.900
Stop!

27:56.290 --> 27:57.130
Stop!

27:57.460 --> 27:59.380
Stop! Stop!

27:59.690 --> 28:00.250
Buddy.

28:00.350 --> 28:01.180
What's going on?

28:01.180 --> 28:01.740
Well,

28:01.740 --> 28:02.740
that lady stole

28:02.740 --> 28:03.540
our ancestral memorial tablet.

28:05.580 --> 28:06.610
Stop!

28:06.900 --> 28:08.580
Get her! Hurry!

28:08.700 --> 28:09.260
Stop!

28:11.220 --> 28:12.780
Stop! Stop!

28:13.540 --> 28:14.700
Stop!

28:17.700 --> 28:18.130
Father.

28:18.690 --> 28:19.830
I didn't know

28:19.860 --> 28:21.260
about the Sun family's doings.

28:21.560 --> 28:23.120
Otherwise, Hua'er

28:23.150 --> 28:24.550
wouldn't be in such danger.

28:25.690 --> 28:27.460
We are preparing for the Mid-Autumn Festival ceremony.

28:28.220 --> 28:29.860
Lizheng and the villagers are busy.

28:30.420 --> 28:32.780
I wonder if they can come and help.

28:36.340 --> 28:36.700
Father,

28:38.660 --> 28:39.900
I don't think it's a big problem.

28:47.980 --> 28:49.850
Stop! Stop!

28:50.200 --> 28:52.410
Stop! Stop!

28:52.900 --> 28:55.500
Stop! Stop!

29:01.130 --> 29:02.380
Am I crazy?

29:02.980 --> 29:03.930
Why am I risking my life

29:04.220 --> 29:05.060
for Lian Hua'er?

29:07.020 --> 29:07.780
I can't run anymore.

29:08.900 --> 29:09.700
I can't run anymore.

29:10.110 --> 29:11.150
They can do whatever they want.

29:33.340 --> 29:34.240
Qingfeng County

29:34.260 --> 29:35.300
is four kilometers away from here.

29:35.760 --> 29:36.220
Are you planning

29:36.220 --> 29:37.300
to lure everyone there on foot?

29:38.060 --> 29:39.000
It was a spur of the moment.

29:39.260 --> 29:40.180
I didn't think it through.

29:41.150 --> 29:42.250
Didn't you say you won't help Hua'er?

29:42.340 --> 29:43.060
I won't help her.

29:44.100 --> 29:45.380
I'm just giving you a ride along the way.

29:47.500 --> 29:48.220
Where did you get the horse?

29:48.500 --> 29:49.220
Lizheng!

29:49.400 --> 29:50.000
Lizheng!

29:50.030 --> 29:51.450
Isn't that your horse?

29:53.420 --> 29:55.300
Get me all our

29:55.530 --> 29:56.810
horse and cow carriages.

29:57.160 --> 29:58.440
Get them back!

29:58.980 --> 29:59.870
Stop!

30:00.010 --> 30:00.540
Stop!

30:00.560 --> 30:01.480
Stop!

30:02.410 --> 30:03.070
Let's go.

30:10.930 --> 30:11.570
Bad news.

30:11.740 --> 30:13.380
Someone from Shisanli Camp is coming.

30:17.700 --> 30:19.460
Why are you panicking? So what?

30:26.620 --> 30:27.460
Master.

30:27.680 --> 30:29.330
What should we do?

30:41.070 --> 30:41.640
Lord Sun,

30:42.220 --> 30:43.460
so many eyes are watching.

30:44.050 --> 30:45.490
I'm afraid even the magistrate won't protect you.

30:48.450 --> 30:50.800
No one can stop me.

30:50.910 --> 30:51.590
Go!

30:52.740 --> 30:53.260
Hua'er!

30:54.260 --> 30:54.780
Hua'er!

30:55.410 --> 30:56.130
Hua'er!

31:01.620 --> 31:02.140
Don't be afraid.

31:04.620 --> 31:05.380
What's going on?

31:05.400 --> 31:07.060
Is this a wedding or a funeral?

31:08.470 --> 31:09.500
Hua'er.

31:09.860 --> 31:10.400
Mother!

31:12.670 --> 31:13.170
Mother.

31:25.020 --> 31:26.200
I disturbed the ancestors today

31:26.420 --> 31:27.220
for Hua'er.

31:27.790 --> 31:28.660
I'm sure the ancestors

31:28.690 --> 31:29.570
will not blame me.

31:30.330 --> 31:31.370
Mr. Lizheng

31:31.600 --> 31:32.950
just led his clan

31:32.980 --> 31:34.590
with great momentum.

31:34.620 --> 31:35.900
You glib-tongued child.

31:36.750 --> 31:37.430
Kneel properly.

31:40.310 --> 31:41.380
Considering that

31:41.800 --> 31:43.120
there was more to the matter,

31:43.490 --> 31:44.330
you may get on your feet.

31:45.880 --> 31:48.800
This matter has been reported to the magistrate of Qingfeng County.

31:49.620 --> 31:50.930
With the public as witness,

31:51.350 --> 31:53.870
Lord Sun won't be able to escape again.

31:55.540 --> 31:56.300
Saving Hua'er

31:56.900 --> 31:58.120
has also saved the image of

31:58.340 --> 31:59.850
our whole village.

32:00.540 --> 32:01.980
Otherwise, if it got out that

32:02.540 --> 32:05.060
Shisanli Camp sold daughters for widow burning,

32:05.470 --> 32:06.700
it would surely implicate the

32:06.790 --> 32:08.290
marriage of many future daughters.

32:08.310 --> 32:09.110
Yes.

32:09.620 --> 32:10.860
You're right.

32:11.860 --> 32:12.430
Man'er.

32:13.180 --> 32:13.940
Remember,

32:14.340 --> 32:16.930
don't touch the ancestral memorial tablet again.

32:17.740 --> 32:18.300
Also,

32:18.810 --> 32:20.030
the guy who

32:20.060 --> 32:20.500
stole my horse...

32:20.520 --> 32:21.240
Lizheng, rest assured.

32:21.900 --> 32:22.940
He won't do it again.

32:23.540 --> 32:24.140
He won't.

32:24.540 --> 32:25.080
He won't.

32:51.700 --> 32:52.580
Do you want some tea?

32:56.020 --> 32:56.820
What did you do to

32:56.930 --> 32:58.380
to my grandma?

33:00.620 --> 33:02.700
She bought so many good things for you.

33:04.300 --> 33:05.180
She didn't buy them.

33:07.220 --> 33:07.950
You bought them yourself?

33:08.220 --> 33:09.220
Where did you get the money?

33:17.300 --> 33:18.300
Could it be...

33:19.090 --> 33:20.650
You took it out

33:21.600 --> 33:22.440
and left it on the table that night.

33:26.780 --> 33:28.490
I forgot my money.

33:31.460 --> 33:33.180
And you spent it all?

33:35.900 --> 33:36.710
Oh, you didn't leave it for me?

33:40.370 --> 33:41.770
How much do you have left?

33:46.910 --> 33:48.710
All gone?

33:54.540 --> 33:55.460
Consider it a loan.

33:56.210 --> 33:57.360
I will pay you triple in the future.

34:04.320 --> 34:06.020
That's 100 taels.

34:07.370 --> 34:08.920
All gone.

34:12.540 --> 34:13.260
Do you know

34:13.389 --> 34:15.560
how much 100 taels is worth?

34:17.300 --> 34:19.010
You spent it all?

34:19.040 --> 34:20.190
Are you crazy, Shen Nuo?

34:20.530 --> 34:22.360
You're here to slow me down.

34:22.480 --> 34:23.380
Give me the money!

34:23.409 --> 34:24.030
Spit it out!

34:24.050 --> 34:25.350
Spit it out!

34:25.380 --> 34:26.500
Why are you so angry?

34:26.920 --> 34:27.750
Calm down.

34:28.730 --> 34:30.120
Spit out the money!

34:31.070 --> 34:32.090
Tell me now!

34:32.110 --> 34:33.409
A gentleman shouldn't fight.

34:33.429 --> 34:34.590
Pay me back!

34:34.620 --> 34:35.330
Matchmaker Wang.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.260
Let's talk it out.

34:37.280 --> 34:38.659
-Let’s talk inside.
-Let’s talk it out.

34:38.889 --> 34:39.639
Let's talk inside.

34:40.580 --> 34:41.620
What's there to talk about?

34:42.060 --> 34:43.139
When it's done,

34:43.370 --> 34:44.310
I should have

34:44.340 --> 34:45.820
what I deserve.

34:45.969 --> 34:48.030
But Lord Sun is now in prison.

34:48.050 --> 34:49.560
Who can I ask for money from?

34:49.940 --> 34:51.110
If you don’t give me

34:51.139 --> 34:52.380
500 taels of silver today,

34:52.540 --> 34:53.860
we’ll all die together

34:53.889 --> 34:54.460
You see...

34:54.670 --> 34:55.909
I will let the villagers

34:56.380 --> 34:57.300
and the Song family

34:57.660 --> 34:58.820
know about

34:58.840 --> 34:59.880
the Lian family's shameful matter.

35:00.340 --> 35:01.620
You still want to be an official?

35:01.860 --> 35:02.660
No way.

35:03.250 --> 35:04.820
Shouren, the money

35:04.860 --> 35:06.340
isn't rightfully yours anyway.

35:06.490 --> 35:07.330
Give it back to Matchmaker Wang.

35:10.380 --> 35:10.980
Father.

35:12.170 --> 35:12.980
I spent

35:13.460 --> 35:14.460
all the

35:14.630 --> 35:15.560
money.

35:30.100 --> 35:30.740
Father.

35:32.090 --> 35:35.300
I have my reasons.

35:41.460 --> 35:42.940
Father, Mother.

35:43.890 --> 35:45.420
Among the betrothal gifts

35:45.510 --> 35:47.200
from the Song family,

35:47.960 --> 35:48.910
there was a

35:48.930 --> 35:50.090
valuable jade pendant.

35:50.290 --> 35:51.200
It was extremely precious.

35:51.900 --> 35:54.380
So they told us many times

35:54.780 --> 35:56.660
for Hua'er to wear it

35:57.200 --> 35:59.390
on the wedding day.

36:00.540 --> 36:01.020
But...

36:02.340 --> 36:03.900
But last month,

36:04.620 --> 36:07.540
we accidentally broke it.

36:08.020 --> 36:09.940
We thought of many ways

36:10.250 --> 36:11.460
and finally found a similar one

36:11.660 --> 36:14.300
in town.

36:15.610 --> 36:16.860
But I never thought

36:17.500 --> 36:19.060
such a small jade pendant

36:19.980 --> 36:21.570
would cost 300...

36:21.600 --> 36:23.240
I mean, 500 taels of silver.

36:24.110 --> 36:26.740
If Shouren went out

36:26.930 --> 36:28.400
to borrow money,

36:29.110 --> 36:31.190
our in-laws would surely find out.

36:31.900 --> 36:34.500
We're doing this to

36:34.540 --> 36:35.580
safeguard Hua'er's marriage.

36:36.720 --> 36:37.920
That's why

36:39.160 --> 36:40.680
we had to do this.

36:42.250 --> 36:43.100
You were willing to sacrifice

36:43.670 --> 36:45.460
your own niece for the dowry.

36:46.020 --> 36:47.060
How could you be so heartless?

36:47.770 --> 36:48.460
Enough!

36:49.220 --> 36:49.950
What's the point of

36:49.980 --> 36:51.200
saying that now?

36:52.300 --> 36:53.710
Your brother has his own way

36:53.880 --> 36:54.520
to get the money.

37:04.820 --> 37:07.640
We're really out of money.

37:07.910 --> 37:08.890
Please help us,

37:09.290 --> 37:11.000
Father, Mother.

37:14.200 --> 37:16.400
You wretch!

37:16.730 --> 37:18.700
I can't live anymore.

37:18.720 --> 37:20.620
I don't want to live anymore.

37:22.300 --> 37:23.540
I don't want to live anymore.

37:25.070 --> 37:25.740
Mother.

37:25.920 --> 37:28.710
Don't cry. It's my fault.

37:28.740 --> 37:29.580
It's my fault

37:29.690 --> 37:31.650
for doing such a foolish thing.

37:32.100 --> 37:32.490
Mother.

37:32.670 --> 37:33.500
I'm doing this

37:33.520 --> 37:34.710
for the Lian family.

37:34.940 --> 37:36.080
For you!

37:38.540 --> 37:39.780
Grandpa, Grandma.

37:40.460 --> 37:42.260
I made a mistake

37:42.300 --> 37:43.940
and caused a disaster.

37:44.620 --> 37:46.590
The Song family promised us

37:46.620 --> 37:48.420
that after I got married,

37:48.540 --> 37:49.700
they would definitely

37:49.740 --> 37:51.380
let Father be an official.

37:51.820 --> 37:53.030
Father just wanted to

37:53.060 --> 37:55.030
help the whole Lian family.

37:55.300 --> 37:56.980
That's why I made this decision.

37:57.660 --> 37:59.050
It's my fault.

37:59.740 --> 38:00.980
It's my fault.

38:01.170 --> 38:02.990
I apologize to you.

38:03.340 --> 38:04.420
I'm unfilial.

38:04.510 --> 38:05.750
Alright.

38:07.060 --> 38:07.860
What can you solve

38:08.460 --> 38:09.460
by kowtowing to me?

38:14.020 --> 38:15.500
We're all from the Lian family.

38:16.580 --> 38:18.140
Let's discuss

38:18.580 --> 38:20.460
to see how we can gather

38:20.460 --> 38:22.420
500 taels of silver

38:22.690 --> 38:23.620
to help Shouren

38:25.800 --> 38:27.300
get through this.

38:33.020 --> 38:34.670
How much money do we have?

38:35.140 --> 38:36.140
Some jewelry

38:36.620 --> 38:38.270
and some

38:38.300 --> 38:38.860
loose silver.

38:39.380 --> 38:40.780
At most...

38:42.050 --> 38:42.910
40 taels.

38:43.060 --> 38:43.900
40 taels!

38:44.300 --> 38:45.790
But Matchmaker Wang said

38:46.890 --> 38:47.640
if we can't

38:47.670 --> 38:49.150
pay her within the next few days,

38:50.100 --> 38:50.460
she

38:51.050 --> 38:53.770
will spread this matter.

38:59.440 --> 39:01.560
Then we can only sell our field.

39:03.510 --> 39:04.020
No.

39:05.060 --> 39:05.580
Father.

39:05.970 --> 39:06.620
Shouren should be

39:06.980 --> 39:08.200
paying the money.

39:08.490 --> 39:08.980
Exactly.

39:09.330 --> 39:10.500
Whoever makes trouble will pay.

39:11.050 --> 39:12.270
Shouyi, He.

39:13.100 --> 39:14.540
We're from the same family.

39:15.210 --> 39:16.580
Now that a family member is in trouble,

39:17.020 --> 39:18.820
you're suddenly treating us like outsiders?

39:20.850 --> 39:22.530
Didn't Young Master Song say

39:22.890 --> 39:24.240
he would only marry Hua'er?

39:24.380 --> 39:24.860
Yes.

39:24.920 --> 39:25.470
Hua'er.

39:26.090 --> 39:27.330
You can go

39:27.350 --> 39:28.870
talk to Young Master Song.

39:29.420 --> 39:30.130
500 taels

39:30.660 --> 39:32.060
is a big deal to our family.

39:32.650 --> 39:33.940
But to his family,

39:34.180 --> 39:35.630
it's just some

39:35.660 --> 39:37.860
spare change.

39:39.060 --> 39:40.740
Is Hua'er

39:41.180 --> 39:42.540
not worth 500 taels?

39:43.020 --> 39:43.460
Exactly.

39:43.770 --> 39:44.720
Is she not worth 500 taels?

39:46.140 --> 39:48.980
But if I ask for money

39:49.180 --> 39:50.500
before I marry to the family,

39:51.300 --> 39:52.460
I will forever

39:53.020 --> 39:55.980
be living in shame.

39:56.660 --> 39:57.900
If Hua'er marries the Song family

39:58.140 --> 39:59.940
and receives their approval,

40:00.560 --> 40:01.200
then,

40:01.880 --> 40:02.570
our whole family

40:02.600 --> 40:03.880
will benefit from it.

40:04.110 --> 40:04.870
Shouyi, He,

40:04.900 --> 40:05.980
you'll surely benefit too.

40:06.000 --> 40:06.750
Oh,

40:06.780 --> 40:07.540
save it.

40:08.180 --> 40:09.620
You live in the town.

40:10.060 --> 40:12.300
Shouren earns grains from being a scholar

40:12.330 --> 40:13.420
and money from being a tutor.

40:14.010 --> 40:14.860
Not only did he not

40:14.900 --> 40:15.980
contribute anything to the family,

40:16.230 --> 40:18.440
but we had to pay him every year

40:18.610 --> 40:19.940
for your enjoyment.

40:20.460 --> 40:21.100
You always said that

40:21.520 --> 40:22.940
after he got promoted,

40:22.960 --> 40:25.180
the rest of us would benefit too.

40:25.980 --> 40:27.940
In the end, not only did we not benefit,

40:28.100 --> 40:29.780
we sold most of our land.

40:30.900 --> 40:31.460
If we sell more,

40:31.850 --> 40:32.340
all of us

40:32.340 --> 40:33.460
will have to live on air.

40:33.630 --> 40:34.900
We all have to live on air.

40:37.180 --> 40:37.940
Shouyi.

40:38.500 --> 40:39.710
Are you determined

40:39.740 --> 40:41.500
not to help me?

40:42.620 --> 40:43.580
You borrowed so much.

40:48.900 --> 40:51.790
Instead of asking the rich family,

40:51.820 --> 40:52.960
his heart, spleen, lungs, and kidneys

40:52.990 --> 40:55.260
have gone black with ill intent.

40:55.260 --> 40:58.290
He wants to sell the land of our ancestors instead.

41:00.180 --> 41:01.260
He might as well

41:01.290 --> 41:02.330
tie the rest of us up

41:02.360 --> 41:04.180
and sell us along with the land.

41:04.220 --> 41:05.060
Anyway,

41:05.100 --> 41:07.260
Hua'er is valuable.

41:07.670 --> 41:09.060
But our child

41:09.100 --> 41:11.720
is not his grandparents' biological grandson.

41:11.900 --> 41:13.300
Shouyi, tell your wife to shut up.

41:19.060 --> 41:19.860
You two, get up too.

41:20.500 --> 41:21.620
You kneel all the time.

41:21.620 --> 41:22.900
Have you no pride?

41:30.820 --> 41:31.260
Grandpa.

41:32.060 --> 41:34.260
Why don't we borrow from Mr. Jin?

41:34.690 --> 41:35.560
Isn't he

41:35.680 --> 41:37.190
the manager of the private bank?

41:37.590 --> 41:39.100
Don't talk nonsense, kid.

41:40.780 --> 41:42.940
We can't borrow from the private bank.

41:43.330 --> 41:45.270
The interest rate is too high, it's not worth it.

41:46.340 --> 41:46.780
Father,

41:47.500 --> 41:48.180
you said

41:49.500 --> 41:51.350
we can never borrow money from the private bank.

41:51.490 --> 41:52.970
Whoever does it, you'll break their legs.

41:53.150 --> 41:53.590
No.

41:54.640 --> 41:55.570
I think it works.

41:56.100 --> 41:57.020
I think it works.

41:57.830 --> 41:59.410
Our father said that back then

41:59.740 --> 42:01.410
because you were gambling.

42:01.990 --> 42:03.260
You gambled your job

42:03.300 --> 42:04.780
and our family savings away.

42:05.010 --> 42:06.400
That's why he said those harsh words.

42:06.740 --> 42:07.820
It's different now.

42:08.780 --> 42:10.770
This is an emergency.

42:11.180 --> 42:11.900
Mother.

42:16.580 --> 42:17.300
It's settled.

42:19.460 --> 42:20.020
Dear.

42:20.620 --> 42:20.980
Shouren.

42:23.260 --> 42:23.980
Ask Jin about this.

42:24.170 --> 42:25.570
Okay.

42:44.220 --> 42:44.900
What are you doing?

42:45.490 --> 42:46.100
I'm watering the vegetables.

42:47.490 --> 42:48.660
Is the jade pendant problem solved?

42:49.900 --> 42:50.940
You're well-informed.

42:51.500 --> 42:52.410
Grandpa is going to borrow money

42:52.440 --> 42:53.120
from Mr. Jin.

42:53.350 --> 42:54.890
It has nothing to do

42:54.920 --> 42:55.730
with me anyway.

42:56.020 --> 42:56.580
Let him be.

42:57.180 --> 42:58.660
Whose name is written

42:59.340 --> 43:00.140
on the bank's account book?

43:00.570 --> 43:01.630
Grandpa's name, of course.

43:06.880 --> 43:07.980
What's with that look?

43:08.500 --> 43:09.300
Just say it.

43:09.980 --> 43:10.780
If I tell you,

43:11.580 --> 43:12.460
how will you repay me?

43:16.060 --> 43:16.500
I...

43:18.500 --> 43:19.100
I just wanted you to

43:19.140 --> 43:20.420
help me clean the woodshed

43:20.510 --> 43:21.830
and dry my quilt in the sun.

43:22.140 --> 43:22.860
What were you thinking?

43:27.140 --> 43:28.020
Nothing.

43:29.330 --> 43:30.730
The woodshed is dirty and damp.

43:31.010 --> 43:32.050
The quilt is wet too.

43:32.580 --> 43:34.260
Sleeping feels like torture every night.

43:34.500 --> 43:34.980
Also,

43:35.250 --> 43:36.490
the spider webs on the beam...

43:36.510 --> 43:37.760
Okay, I know.

43:37.880 --> 43:38.590
I know.

43:39.180 --> 43:40.820
You just miss your comfortable life.

43:41.620 --> 43:42.280
I'll do it.

43:43.300 --> 43:46.300
So, what's the problem

43:46.470 --> 43:47.540
with borrowing from the private bank?

43:53.710 --> 43:54.940
It matters whose name you use

43:55.210 --> 43:56.890
to borrow the money.

43:57.540 --> 43:58.300
If the money

43:58.320 --> 43:59.520
is borrowed under your grandpa's name,

43:59.890 --> 44:01.280
your whole family will be implicated

44:01.940 --> 44:02.980
if Hua'er refuses to

44:03.000 --> 44:04.440
pay the money in the future.

44:05.590 --> 44:06.420
You're right!

44:06.440 --> 44:07.440
Why didn't I think of it?

44:08.300 --> 44:09.580
It was my idea too.

44:10.180 --> 44:10.770
That was close.

44:16.010 --> 44:17.020
It's a good thing you're smart.

44:24.180 --> 44:29.460
[Mission: 1,000 taels of gold]

44:24.180 --> 44:29.460
[Income: 0]

44:24.180 --> 44:29.460
[Expenses: Shen Nuo’s furniture purchase -100 taels
